%%% note
A2A コネクタ 1.1.1 のタスクの記録と認可。authorization-listener (認可の要るメソッドの前に流れ、失敗すれば
Unauthorized)、tasks/get (historyLength で履歴を切る)、tasks/cancel、既にあるタスクへの message/send の検査、
taskHistoryEnabled=false。クライアントの get-task / cancel-task。@TID@ / @CID@ は前に Task を返した応答の ID。
%%% port 18163
%%% request POST /t/rpc
Content-Type: text/plain

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"message/send","params":{"message":{"kind":"message","role":"user","messageId":"u-1","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"work"}]}}}

%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": 200,
  "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"result\":{\"id\":\"<tid>\",\"contextId\":\"<cid>\",\"status\":{\"state\":\"working\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"agent\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"working\",\"kind\":\"text\"}],\"messageId\":\"m-work\",\"kind\":\"message\"},\"timestamp\":\"<ts>\"},\"artifacts\":[{\"artifactId\":\"a1\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"part 1\",\"kind\":\"text\"}]}],\"history\":[],\"kind\":\"task\"}}"
}
%%% request POST /t/rpc
Content-Type: text/plain

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tasks/get","params":{"id":"@TID@"}}

%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": 403,
  "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"error\":{\"code\":-32005,\"message\":\"Unauthorized\"}}"
}
